mila","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk45/shows/0d49b0c7-aa8b-46ea-8a7c-18a2557130cb.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk51/shows/efe1f3fd-93b4-4670-83bf-680890eefcc4.jpg","likes":363,"dislikes":6,"views":37191,"release_date":"1520380800000","length":5452,"description":"This wonderful story happened in the age of valiant knights, beautiful princesses, and battling sorcerers. Ruslan, a wandering artist dreaming to become a knight, met beautiful Mila and fell in love with her; he didn't even suspect that she is the King's daughter. However, the lovers' happiness wasn't meant to last too long. Chernomor, the evil sorcerer, appeared in a magic vortex and stole Mila right before Ruslan's eyes to transform her power of love into his own magic power. Without further ado, Ruslan sets out on a chase after the stolen princess to overcome all obstacles and to prove that real love is stronger than magic.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.5}],"value":6.5,"age":"N/A"},"episode_id":9060,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}